abstract: >-
  Empirical investigation of autoregressive next-token predictability bounds on irrational
  constants (pi, e, sqrt(2)), PRNGs, structured mathematical sequences, and hidden
  multi-lag CSPRNG backdoors using matched-parameter neural architectures (MLP, 1D-CNN,
  GRU, Causal Mini-Transformer), PPM-C compression, mechanistic interpretability
  (head ablation, embedding geometry, linear probing), and an interactive Browser ONNX +
  BYO-GPU web laboratory.
